#: scenario8:scenario8_17527806_B238_4C61_8539_8CC86EDB4A37
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 893898f1776403b3c8a44eefae7db77cc016de6bc9220cde8b6f234c1310a6ff
#. default-sha256: b220d65f2fad0109546b3f6bf4d42b1cef610d2bec7e5379aa2e5afb83e48b63
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_17527806_B238_4C61_8539_8CC86EDB4A37"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I’m staring into "
"a pair of ruby red eyes, open wide with shock.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I recall snapping at him, "
"insulting him, but I don’t remember what I said.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Nor do I remember how he "
"responded.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫All I know is that a wave of churning blackness appeared out of "
"nowhere, ⟪k:24⟫washing me away.⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫I’m powerless.⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Helpless.⟪k:31⟫"
"⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Hopeless.⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫My young mind sucked into it like a whirlpool."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　눈앞에 경악에 찬 붉은 눈동자"
"가 있었다.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　그 놈에게 무슨 폭언을 했던 것도 같은데, 뭐라 했는지 떠오르지도 않는다."
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　그 놈이 뭐라 응수했는지도.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫　나, 야코포의 의식은 갑자기 나타난 검은 파도"
"에 휩쓸려――⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫　어쩔 도리도 없이,⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫　저항도 못 하고,⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫　무력하게,"
"⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫　삼켜졌으니 말이다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F8B2A1AC_C883_43F2_8F6F_F1E7315C405F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 034576a8d7fa49b414b6c6ff3499fb495fcfa5ba34ce61c0df3258e3f5588329
#. default-sha256: cfa3a409c25841a825302813ca5e0e306a65a5dc77c01b7d1c28c5bfafa6e955
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F8B2A1AC_C883_43F2_8F6F_F1E7315C405F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Young”? ⟪k:1⟫My ⟪k:2⟫young⟪k:3⟫ mind?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Oh, for Christ’s sake. ⟪k:7⟫You have "
"⟪k:8⟫got⟪k:9⟫ to be kidding me.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why—⟪k:13⟫for the love of god, ⟪k:14⟫why⟪k:15⟫—"
"⟪k:16⟫am I being made to look back at this part of my life? ⟪k:17⟫The miserable, stupid fucking "
"romantic I once was. ⟪k:18⟫Why am I turning back into the boy I tried so hard to forget?⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Where did this absurd black smoke come from, and why can’t I get out of it?⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫If it’s that white-haired man who’s doing this to me, ⟪k:25⟫then he’s not an angel or "
"a prophet—⟪k:26⟫he’s the goddamned Devil himself."
msgstr ""
"　……야코포? ⟪k:0⟫야코포라고?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　이봐, 이게 뭔 웃기지도 않는 경우야…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　영주인 내"
"가 왜 이런 꼴을 당해?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　왜――⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　돌이키기도 싫은 게 눈앞에 있고……⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　내 "
"존재가 그 시절의 꿈만 많은 철부지로……⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　돌아가려…… 하는 건데…….⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　왜 이런 비"
"현실적인 어둠이 나를 에워싼 건데…….⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　만약 그 남자가 내게 이런 걸 보게 한 거라면"
"――⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫　그 놈은 예언자나 천사가 아니라 악독한 악마야."

#: scenario8:scenario8_786D373C_CF6E_4B10_A7A3_D6A9902D5356
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 680a4d24b51bca033649c2ddebc030cbf91afea0fefa5e24d401a3484427739e
#. default-sha256: 541cc4696bec72cd482e649cee544847d8fc6ffc6927cd39f6e9d533d45a2ebb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_786D373C_CF6E_4B10_A7A3_D6A9902D5356"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫To be blunt, the "
"world’s a small place.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫There’s an unimaginable amount of it out there, but you "
"only ever get to see a minuscule fraction of that. ⟪k:18⟫And that goes doubly so for us—⟪k:19⟫the "
"poor barely get the chance to see any of it at all.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫And those who were "
"born into affluence, well, they have no idea just how small ⟪k:24⟫our⟪k:25⟫ world really is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　조금 뻔한 표현을 쓰자"
"면, 세계는 결국 작을 것이다.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　토지나 규모를 따지면 매우 넓지만, 이 눈에 보이는 세계는 "
"작기만 하다.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　특히 우리 같은 인간이 보는 세계는 제한되어 있다. ⟪k:18⟫우리란 건 즉―― 빈"
"민이다.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫　처음부터 모든 걸 가진 인간은 우리의 세계가 얼마나 좁은지…… 모를 것이다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EE2C8230_1730_4B5F_AA1D_4638F60D5709
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a55e7739cc9fe338c42fcb9f6df0d03c36c37205e8636d51d2f971ac3bc0616
#. default-sha256: 6fd6407ba4282a146c0cb0dc24bfd1db7019304684dbab95da5859a533b8047c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EE2C8230_1730_4B5F_AA1D_4638F60D5709"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A close friend of mine—a prostitute—said she thought it might be a psychological thing, but "
"regardless, I continued applying the ointment to Morgana’s face.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Hey. C’mon, "
"don’t turn away from me.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“............”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“I know you can hear me. "
"⟪k:11⟫I brought ointment, so let me put it on you.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“It’s a waste of time.”⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“You don’t know that. ⟪k:18⟫Your arms look much better than before.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫It "
"won’t be long before your face starts healing too.”⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫“The ointment isn’t free. "
"⟪k:24⟫You’re wasting your money.”⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫“It’s my money. I can use it however I please. "
"So just shut up and let me do this.”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫“You’re a very obnoxious man, you "
"know.”⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫“What was that? You want me to rub it in ⟪k:34⟫real hard⟪k:35⟫, "
"huh?”⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Fine...”"
msgstr ""
"　창녀 친구는 정신적인 문제인 거 아니냐 했는데, 뭐가 됐든 내가 가능한 건 모르가나의 얼굴에도 꾸준"
"히 연고를 바르는 것뿐이었다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「야, 야, 이쪽 좀 봐」⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「…………」⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫「무"
"시하지 마. ⟪k:7⟫약 바르러 온 거야, 고마운 줄 알고 얼굴 대」⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫「……무의미해요……」⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫「무의미할지 아닐진 모를 일이지? ⟪k:12⟫팔이 많이 나아졌으니, 얼굴도 나을걸」⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫「……"
"약을 사는 데에도 돈이 들잖아요. ⟪k:15⟫아까워요……」⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫「내가 좋아서 하는 거야. 잔말 말고 "
"얼굴이나 대 봐」⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫「……말도 많은 사람……」⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫「으응~? ⟪k:22⟫쑤시도록 난폭하게 발"
"라 줄까?」⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫「……대면 되잖아요……」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_44551E5A_FE36_4981_BA52_B63592A3B670
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad1dfd1b772c3fca6dd2e557052d6047558720e20424d7b7cccfad4e9fb92a98
#. default-sha256: 3238168ca9c988869ab76636ac28102df5b8ee852e45a25e7ec16a5b5ef7d8ef
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_44551E5A_FE36_4981_BA52_B63592A3B670"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I hope you’re prepared to be let down, if I ever do heal.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“That "
"possibility’s just part of the fun.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“You have as much tact as a worm.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫“No tact ⟪k:10⟫and⟪k:11⟫ bad taste. ⟪k:12⟫I’m a real winner.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“It’s a "
"wonder no one throttles you in your sleep.”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Being a guy, of course I would "
"have been pleased if she turned out pretty with her face healed, ⟪k:20⟫but her life was "
"guaranteed to be easier than now no matter what she looked like. ⟪k:21⟫That was what really "
"mattered, ultimately. ⟪k:22⟫I could only imagine how hard it was to have your life turned "
"completely upside-down at the age of nine.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫A large portion of us in the slums "
"had our share of misfortune,⟪k:26⟫but hardly any of them stacked up to what Morgana had had to "
"bear."
msgstr ""
"「……낫더라도 실망할걸요」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「실망하는 것도 즐길 보람이 있지」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「……취향 참 고약하"
"네요……」⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「더구나 성격도 고약하지. ⟪k:6⟫나는 괴상한 걸 좋아하나 봐」⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫「무슨 말"
"이……」⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　그야 물론 나도 남자니까, 모르가나의 얼굴이 예쁘면 그럭저럭 기쁘긴 할 것이"
"다.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　하지만 민낯이 크게 예쁘지 않더라도, 지금보다 살기 편해질 것임은 명백하다.⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫　그러니 그거면 되지 않을까? ⟪k:16⟫불과 아홉 살에 살 길이 막막해지는 건 고달플 테니 말이다."
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫　빈민가에는 불행한 놈이 지천에 널렸지만, 모르가나의 처량함에 견줄 놈은 쉽게 못 찾는"
"다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_47D71963_0C1B_4A04_9238_A6D9D35E9356
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13da4dccedcd14c986aa7641a906e6db8af6566f9f8632b3a7b4b2d862c29fe1
#. default-sha256: d42f452feaab0c2043e9971f4c20edbab9dd3e576682123650e3016c836122e0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47D71963_0C1B_4A04_9238_A6D9D35E9356"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I’ll still be your friend, even if you turn out to be the ugliest girl in the city. ⟪k:1⟫"
"You should be grateful.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“How is it you haven’t managed to chase off everyone in "
"your life yet?”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“I act like a decent guy around other people. ⟪k:8⟫Do my best to "
"fit in.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Then why are you such a dolt around me?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“Just doing "
"my best to fit in.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“So you’re saying this is ⟪k:18⟫my⟪k:19⟫ fault?”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫“Everyone could use a thorn or two, makes ’em more exciting—⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫you "
"especially.”⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"「네 민낯이 괴상망측해도 친구로 지내 주겠단 거야. ⟪k:0⟫고마운 줄 알아」⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「당신, 성격이 그"
"런데 용케 발이 넓네요……」⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「남들 앞에선 잘하고 다니거든. ⟪k:5⟫그럭저럭 좋은 녀석처럼 굴"
"고, 붙임성 좋게도 굴어」⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫「……왜 제 앞에선 성격이 고약해지는 건데요」⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫「너한테 맞"
"추다 보니 이렇게 됐어」⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫「제 성격이 고약하단 건가요……」⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫「성격은 조금 고약"
"한 편이 재밌지. ⟪k:14⟫특히 너는 더 그렇고」⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫「…………」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FDA66FD5_460B_4F50_8145_DA7B8D4EA247
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bf0e92b54237c4fe4ad08161b985138d2b7645638805d6c2d455cf2469585c8
#. default-sha256: 277639f942a6fd0a58663eed920a6ae6d2c71d0c6d479d751d63adc7644c6e03
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FDA66FD5_460B_4F50_8145_DA7B8D4EA247"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Okay, that should be everything. ⟪k:1⟫Does it sting anywhere?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Not "
"particularly, no.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“All right. ⟪k:8⟫Oh, also, finish up here and get back to Maria "
"soon.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Unless you’d rather I drag you there.”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“Why?”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫“Seriously? It’s your damned birthday, that’s why.”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“...And?”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫“What do you ⟪k:23⟫think⟪k:24⟫, dimwit?! ⟪k:25⟫She wants to celebrate!”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫“............”⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫“Get back there soon, okay? I’m planning to drop by "
"too.”⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫“............”⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Okay?”⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫⟪k:41⟫"
"⟪k:42⟫“Okay...”"
msgstr ""
"「자, 다 발랐어. ⟪k:0⟫어디 쑤시진 않아?」⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「……안 쑤셔요……」⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「그래. ⟪k:5⟫……야, "
"오늘은 기도 일찌감치 마치고 창관으로 돌아가. ⟪k:6⟫꼭이다」⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫「……왜요」⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫「왜고 자"
"시고―― 오늘은 네 생일이잖아?」⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫「………그게 어쨌는데요?」⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫「축하해 주겠단 거"
"야! ⟪k:15⟫그게 어쨌긴, ⟪k:16⟫무슨……!」⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫「…………」⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫「일찍 돌아가, 나도 참석할 "
"거야」⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫「…………」⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫「대답은 어쨌어」⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫「……응……」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_12FD5CC1_0497_4182_B707_99378FD205DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 974b3313cc4abe205a50fcabcf12c50d612d8280879f22f093404fb4e487ef25
#. default-sha256: 0eceedfd88609ba22b755380aa13683e1e71a15cf91a65c585f9234afa344b5c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_12FD5CC1_0497_4182_B707_99378FD205DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“So hey, uh...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“...I thought you were leaving?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“One day, I’ll "
"show you the world.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“...I won’t get my hopes up.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“⟪k:13⟫"
"Get⟪k:14⟫ your hopes up, dammit,” ⟪k:15⟫I said with a soft chuckle, and then I took my leave."
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫I had every intention of making good on that promise, ⟪k:20⟫and I had "
"more than enough reason to believe I could."
msgstr ""
"「야, 저기 말이야」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「……할 말이 더 있나요」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「넓은 세계를 보여 줄게」⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"「……기대는…… 안 할게요」⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫「……기대 좀 해……」⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　나는 쓴웃음을 남기고, 그 자"
"리를 떴다.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　――그 말은 결코 몽상으로 끝낼 생각이 없었다. ⟪k:13⟫게다가 나는 그게 가능하"
"리란 근거도 있었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3E897460_E262_4F70_8E88_EAA7C66318F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eea4186d86e5c87a9ade5011e2816c6ddd34aa6ee53974f56e2d6b964867ad75
#. default-sha256: 82765fa1118756de382ec39ba1a062d092cb4bc3719a024dfd0315adea0e7a15
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3E897460_E262_4F70_8E88_EAA7C66318F2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With the help of a slave trader, I infiltrated the lord’s manor. ⟪k:1⟫I’d known slaves "
"weren’t treated well, but seeing it for myself, I thought most of these people would have been "
"happier having been born as a dog or cat and owned by someone who actually had a heart. ⟪k:2⟫It "
"was revolting, a flagrant injustice.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Broadly speaking, there are two types of "
"people who see injustice in the world:⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The first are those who have everything, who "
"sit unchallenged at the top of the world, looking down on the less fortunate with pity.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The second are those with nothing, who wish to overthrow the entire system keeping "
"them down. ⟪k:13⟫It should come as no surprise that I fell in the second camp."
msgstr ""
"　나는 노예상인의 협력을 얻어서 노예로 위장하여 영주 저택에 잠입했다. ⟪k:0⟫노예가 인간 취급을 못 "
"받는 건 알고 있었는데, 이래선 개나 고양이로 태어나 양심 있는 사람에게 길러지는 게 훨씬 낫지 않을"
"까 싶을 지경이었다. ⟪k:1⟫그 순간, 내 마음 속에 타오른 건 명백한 정의감이었으리라.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　"
"정의감―― 이 감정은 이분화가 가능하다. ⟪k:5⟫처음부터 모든 걸 가져서 자존감 높은 인간은 본인이 압도"
"적으로 우월하기 때문에 아랫것들을 불쌍해한다. ⟪k:6⟫그런 정의감과…… 처음부터 가진 거 없고 자존감 낮"
"은 인간이 모든 걸 뒤엎으려는 증오에서 파생된 정의감. ⟪k:7⟫나는 명백한 후자였다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9BC291E3_6970_4E11_A3DF_B4978E3C6180
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b40e6b852a135f112900f39af5c4076c9ffdb8ccfd09ec45c61de4bf8e50a8c2
#. default-sha256: a91dcd3dd427002d9f9ae3ef3148dd55471d0e6eec69fbacff08db17a83133a5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9BC291E3_6970_4E11_A3DF_B4978E3C6180"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had neither the money nor the power to guarantee them a ⟪k:1⟫good⟪k:2⟫ life on the "
"outside, ⟪k:3⟫but that hardly mattered to them. ⟪k:4⟫Everyone was sure that wherever they ended "
"up would be better than staying, and I prayed that would be the case.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It was "
"during the revolt that I saved Morgana. ⟪k:9⟫I would have sent her off somewhere else like all "
"the other slaves, but she was in so dire a condition when I found her that she could hardly even "
"move on her own. She had been sapped of all her willpower.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫So I brought her to "
"the brothel where a friend of mine worked and asked her to take Morgana in."
msgstr ""
"　도망 끝에 행복이 찾아올 것은 약속할 수 없었다. ⟪k:0⟫그것까지 책임질 권력과 돈은 내게 없었다. "
"⟪k:1⟫그래도 노예들은 지금보단 나을 것이리라 믿었고, 나도 그러길 바랐다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　모르가나"
"를 구출한 건 그때였다. ⟪k:5⟫실은 모르가나도 탈출한 여타 노예들처럼 다른 곳으로 보내야 했지만, 그 "
"당시 모르가나는 알아서 움직일 수 있는 상태가 아니던 데다, 그럴 기력도 없었다.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　그래서―― "
"나는 창녀 친구에게 가서 모르가나를 창관에 숨겨 달라 부탁했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_74EA2888_A79D_42A3_82B0_B823D2B2D445
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbd6c49e2eb0f2fe6dd0fe4a2b03d847f534d4f837dda323e41a47195d487e29
#. default-sha256: 18ca9767023cf5d3a2cc2f1d6ace125f73b95dd58d84ce53accbd22a1e539bf7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_74EA2888_A79D_42A3_82B0_B823D2B2D445"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My companions and I reveled in the revolt’s success. ⟪k:1⟫It wasn’t enough of an "
"accomplishment to have any real political implications, but we still felt like heroes. ⟪k:2⟫Drunk "
"on victory, we started talking about going bigger, starting a full-on revolution.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Once the elation passed, though, we realized there wasn’t much more we ⟪k:7⟫could⟪k:8⟫ do. "
"⟪k:9⟫Even if we did manage to start a large enough uprising to kill the lord, we were only "
"peasants. ⟪k:10⟫Not only did we not know the first thing about ruling, the other counts would "
"never acknowledge our authority anyway. ⟪k:11⟫We’d pretend to be in control until the next in "
"line showed up, and that would be the end of that.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫So we just ended up "
"sitting on our thumbs, no way to do anything about our discontent."
msgstr ""
"　반란 계획이 성공하여 나와 동료들은 이 위업에 도취되었다. ⟪k:0⟫그건 정치 자체를 바꿀 만한 건은 아"
"니었지만, 자신이 꼭 영웅이 된 듯한 기분에 빠지게 했다. ⟪k:1⟫우쭐해진 우리는 점점 목적이 비약돼서 "
"혁명을 일으키자느니 하는 소리를 했다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　하지만 냉정해지고 나니, 우리가 가능한 건 여"
"기까지란 사실이 실감되었다. ⟪k:5⟫폭동을 더 크게 키워 영주의 목숨을 빼앗더라도, 왕족도 뭣도 아닌 우"
"리가 도시를 통치하는 건 불가능하다. ⟪k:6⟫제후들이 이를 인정하지 않을 것이며, 다른 왕족이 오면 그대"
"로 끝이다.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　그래서 우리는 다음 행동을 일으키지 않고 정체되어 있었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A1BD576_09C0_4986_8C40_319702E00365
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c784a51ccab4cd838b6a4639e9ffb5b2389c063fd4a49c4bddb795373d917153
#. default-sha256: 8247658ac6c96cd8431f9656ef60cf98a50fa7fc21be804ae675eb086d2ee180
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1A1BD576_09C0_4986_8C40_319702E00365"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The revelation came completely out of the blue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫According to her, I had royal "
"blood, and if we could convince the lord of that, I would become royalty. Furthermore, she—as my "
"alleged mother—could return to her old life at the manor.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The woman urged me "
"to take action—⟪k:8⟫to meet the lord, reveal my lineage, and claim—no, ⟪k:9⟫reclaim⟪k:10⟫ my "
"rightful place at the Barnier house.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I would no longer be a poor peasant living in the "
"slums. I would have a comfortable life."
msgstr ""
"　청천벽력 같은 소식이었다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　그 여자 말로는 내게 정통 왕가의 피가 흐른다나 보다. ⟪k:2⟫이"
"를 영주가 인정하게 하면 나는 왕족으로 인정받으며, 내 어머니를 자칭하는 그 여자도 왕족 관계자로서 "
"원래 생활로 복귀할 수 있다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　여자는 내게 판단을 촉구했다. ⟪k:6⟫영주에게 가서 출신"
"을 밝히고, 그 일족에 들어갈 것을―― 아니, 돌아갈 것을. ⟪k:7⟫그러면 내 생활이 훨씬 나아질 것이며, 빈"
"민이란 입장에서 벗어날 수도 있다 한다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E6ED4178_99E0_463E_83AF_15CF0FA076A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5eb5498e38403a7697d83dac23b8b3d8054c7deff3f1ece8c8e757f72369ded7
#. default-sha256: 577081cc6921389b29c778f8827e4580571cc277e6a6aca3df3b6ac1404ddb14
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E6ED4178_99E0_463E_83AF_15CF0FA076A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Have you decided what you’re going to give her?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫That was the "
"very first thing I heard when I stepped through the back door of the brothel. ⟪k:7⟫Maria—a short, "
"blonde-haired prostitute and good friend of mine—flashed me a devilish smirk."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「……그래서, 그 애한테 줄 거 정했어?」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　창관 뒷문으로 들어가자마자 짧은 금"
"발 창녀가 말을 걸었다. ⟪k:5⟫이 녀석은 마리아, 내 친구다. ⟪k:6⟫마리아는 히죽거리고 있었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CEC00B65_8D47_4DDF_8848_0962A01CA367
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85827714ebbd9adbac45c2f6a8eb0f04ffebf50c18c18452d3ecd0adcf01d31e
#. default-sha256: af5cd110bd60e18703002eaac6dcb2f80182c44ff5bdf33ca4faeb55b1bbc088
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CEC00B65_8D47_4DDF_8848_0962A01CA367"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I bought a necklace, as per your suggestion. ⟪k:1⟫Girls appreciate that sort of thing, "
"don’t they?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Most do. ⟪k:5⟫Me, I’ve got a taste for knives and other such pointy "
"things. ⟪k:6⟫I doubt she has much interest in those, though.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Sometimes, I wonder "
"if you’re actually a girl.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Anyone could see that Maria and I were close, "
"but our relationship was strictly platonic. ⟪k:14⟫Of course, given her line of work, it was "
"unavoidable that people thought otherwise."
msgstr ""
"「조언 들은 대로 목걸이를 샀어. ⟪k:0⟫여자는 그런 걸 좋아하지?」⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「보통은 그렇지. ⟪k:3⟫나"
"야 뭐, 날붙이처럼 날카로운 게 좋지만서도? ⟪k:4⟫그 애는 안 그럴 거 아냐」⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫「너는 진짜 여"
"자 같지 않구만……」⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　나와 마리아는 누가 봐도 친밀해 보일 것이다. ⟪k:10⟫하지만 그건 "
"진짜로 친구라 그렇다. ⟪k:11⟫주위에서는 그렇게 안 볼 테고, 마리아가 창녀인 걸 고려하자면, 나와 이 "
"녀석 간에 육체 관계가 있을 거라 넘겨짚는 건 어쩔 수 없다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB7592BD_E5CE_4BB4_8016_F5FF4A31A8DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd1f8b8a71bb506b7491aa2726e3847739a3424a0c707007dcbb4d3336a6a065
#. default-sha256: eabd254f6fb6f4cad5702baf3d5b746952cc03d024fda166ee63db15e335c80f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BB7592BD_E5CE_4BB4_8016_F5FF4A31A8DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And honestly, it irritated me every time someone suggested we were anything more than "
"friends. ⟪k:1⟫People have this annoying, shortsighted tendency to assume that just because a guy "
"and a girl are friendly, they must be intimate. ⟪k:2⟫It didn’t matter that she was a girl; I only "
"thought of her as a friend, and as best as I could tell, that’s all she thought of me as well."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Maria and I first met when we were children. ⟪k:7⟫Even at that age, she was "
"already a prostitute—myself a petty thief. ⟪k:8⟫We were both incredibly lucky to have survived to "
"adulthood with only ourselves to watch each others’ backs.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫It’s possible the only "
"reason either of us maintained the willpower to survive this long was because we had each other "
"to bitch about life to when things got bad."
msgstr ""
"　그런 오해를 살 때마다, 솔직히 말해서 조금은 화가 난다. ⟪k:0⟫남녀가 친밀하다고 바로 연애 같은 거"
"랑 엮는 건 단락적이다. ⟪k:1⟫남녀 같은 건 상관없다. ⟪k:2⟫나는 마리아를 소중한 친구로 여기며, 마리아"
"도 그럴 거라 믿는다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　마리아와 처음 만난 건 우리가 어릴 때였다. ⟪k:6⟫마리아는 어릴 "
"때부터 창녀였고, 나는 좀도둑 같이 살았다. ⟪k:7⟫서로 의지할 건 제 몸뚱이 뿐인 환경인데도, 어른이 "
"될 때까지 성장했으니 참 운이 좋았다.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　……힘든 일이 있을 때, 서로 슬픔을 흘릴 수 있었기에"
"―― 어른이 될 때까지 힘낸 걸 수도 있겠다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_398D5BC2_37AD_4D31_86CE_A380A363D7A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 429feab68fbd4cd9afec527c01a4623fa4f6da0da1681a5ff29c89e5308f53d1
#. default-sha256: 95fb9f7a3135cfc62def1520ee606b2399f974c0d69931862e92b36fa97cff48
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_398D5BC2_37AD_4D31_86CE_A380A363D7A8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I chewed over what Maria had said as I watched her disappear down a brothel corridor. ⟪k:1⟫"
"She wasn’t wrong. She wasn’t overanalyzing.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I did, indeed, have special "
"feelings for Morgana."
msgstr ""
"　복도로 가는 마리아를 보며, 나는 조금 고민했다. ⟪k:0⟫그렇다……, 마리아의 말은 지레짐작이 아닌―― 사"
"실이다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　나는 모르가나를 특별하게 여겼다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DFD2E726_2ACA_4628_9B52_B8CFD39C2687
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d24dc8bb5f7cae820cf61ce8cfc126463e80742a9f176d72ff008ef7b380240c
#. default-sha256: c36736e18911f7082ead4801b765e1786637759bbc6a49e13ca6dc468e337b4f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DFD2E726_2ACA_4628_9B52_B8CFD39C2687"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Any other girl Morgana’s age just looked like another kid to me. ⟪k:1⟫So why was she any "
"different?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She was covered in scars, and every other time we met, she would tell me "
"to go to Hell, and she refused to walk anywhere with me, and no matter how much ice I broke, I "
"could never seem to get all the way through.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Yet still, the world felt like it was "
"just a little bit better a place when I was with her.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫It made me want to see her "
"smile, no matter how grotesque her face."
msgstr ""
"　이런 마음은 모르가나에게만 품었다. ⟪k:0⟫열두 살쯤 되어 보이는 소녀를 보면 그냥 애구나 싶은 게 다"
"다. ⟪k:1⟫그런데 왜 모르가나에겐 이러는지…… 내가 제일 궁금하다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　모르가나는 얼굴이 추하"
"고, 입만 열면 지옥에나 떨어지라 그러고, 좀처럼 옆을 걸으려 하질 않고, 조금 친해지긴 했어도 거리를 "
"두는 편인데 말이다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　그래도…… 모르가나 곁에 있으면 세계가 조금이나마 따스하게 느껴졌다."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　그렇기에 비록 얼굴이 추하더라도 조금이나마 웃어 주길――⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　바라기 시작했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_27A0BE22_4D24_451D_9ECE_BCD50CB3BFFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f3a3b1c76988b1027bd876a125e4f8100c3bedc3c21b85cd598f925890fdd6a
#. default-sha256: dfd08d6efa6ef8440c4fafacde0191751f0406aab2d05dd1466f84e4e59ddf07
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_27A0BE22_4D24_451D_9ECE_BCD50CB3BFFB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You guys think you could maybe... change the subject?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Like we have anything "
"⟪k:4⟫else⟪k:5⟫ to talk about.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Making the birthday girl want to hide in a corner "
"defeats the whole purpose, don’t you think?”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Oh, no, don’t mind me. ⟪k:12⟫I "
"don’t have anything I want to talk about,” ⟪k:13⟫Morgana said almost in a whisper, her head "
"downturned."
msgstr ""
"「저기, 너희 화제 좀 고르지 그래?」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「우리가 꺼낼 화제라곤 이런 거밖에 없는데?」⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫「그래도 오늘 주역은 이 녀석이잖아. 꿀 먹은 벙어리 만들어서 어쩌잔 거야」⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「……아뇨, "
"저는 됐어요…… 할 말이 없거든요. ⟪k:6⟫여러분 편한 대로 하세요」⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　모르가나는 고개 숙"
"인 채 작은 목소리로 말했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A1D16C1_7EF0_4801_8B4B_A1B9B16DC88A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee13fb505bc91c28dc83ee3de4afed69f80a3a288dd768a2b5e32889e7111bdb
#. default-sha256: 719dea7a871df0032f93ff6b6244da0ff8bb1775a2ef510bcbd02d7f3cfda0b8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A1D16C1_7EF0_4801_8B4B_A1B9B16DC88A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Say, the young man over—”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Wait! Stop right there! ⟪k:4⟫Don’t say another "
"word!”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Whoopsie. Me and my big mouth. I almost did your job for you...”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫“G— Dammit, Maria!”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫This was not good. ⟪k:15⟫Like hell I was going "
"to let her corner me into saying it here.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫I stole a glance at Morgana, but her "
"gaze was locked on her knees.⟪k:19⟫I couldn’t see what—if any—kind of reaction she was having."
msgstr ""
"「무슨 잡초냐면, 저기 있는――」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「야, 야 멈춰! ⟪k:2⟫그만둬! ⟪k:3⟫뭘 말하려는 거야!!」⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫「어이쿠, 이건 네 입으로 말해야 하나~?」⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫「마리아, 너, 너 인마……!!」⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫　이 흐름은 좋지 않다. ⟪k:11⟫엉겁결에 말하긴 싫다. ⟪k:12⟫황급히 모르가나를 보니, 역시 무슨 "
"생각인지 모르게 고개만 숙이고 있었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EEF8DE47_7C47_4EE9_9EF5_BB0CB2812232
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23dd7630d939c1b625e8d4d5601bd8d38737570c50cd1347824d91b905703988
#. default-sha256: db2bc91741dcb9c4554d6496c3c202b215e01d7e5e15fc39837ec74c523c7ead
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EEF8DE47_7C47_4EE9_9EF5_BB0CB2812232"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I, uh, Morgana... what she was trying to say is...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“Is that I, um, I...”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“...I have to go.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“...What?”⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“I have to go to the bathroom.”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“S-Sure.”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫"
"Morgana got up from her chair and left the room in silence.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫I imagine I was making a "
"rather flaccid expression, because as soon⟪k:25⟫as Morgana was gone, Maria began cackling like a "
"madwoman. ⟪k:26⟫My reply was the nearest object, courtesy of my throwing arm."
msgstr ""
"「저기, 모르가나……, 방금 건, 그게……」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「…………」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「그게 말이지, 저……」⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"「……용변을」⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫「……응?」⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫「용변을 보고 올게요」⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫「……그, 그래」⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　모르가나는 그러며 일어서더니, 방에서 나갔다.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　남은 나는 아마 매우 얼빠"
"진 표정을 지었으리라.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫　마리아가 폭소했다. ⟪k:19⟫나는 물건을 집어던졌다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4ECBE237_62DE_470D_91CF_D30816E25ADF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27d2b96855606e59859e75585f13206c451b1e0e0e0fef986ba3de2ae89122e3
#. default-sha256: d0a0603aca2c3e4a5caf59703048c3b022829edbbe9c4ab73809814674a2af2b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4ECBE237_62DE_470D_91CF_D30816E25ADF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Looooser. ⟪k:1⟫How hard is it to just ⟪k:2⟫say it⟪k:3⟫?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“It would have been "
"easier if you hadn’t cornered me like that!”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“You think I believe you would’ve done "
"it ⟪k:10⟫without⟪k:11⟫ a little nudge?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“I-I would have. ⟪k:15⟫"
"Eventually...”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“Eventually ain’t gonna cut it. ⟪k:19⟫Now⟪k:20⟫’s the right time. "
"⟪k:21⟫And don’t worry, me and the girls won’t make fun of you for getting your rocks off to "
"little girls!”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“That’s not the reason I like her! ⟪k:25⟫Besides, I would, um, I "
"would wait at least four years before—”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫“Doesn’t mean you can’t ⟪k:29⟫tell "
"her⟪k:30⟫ now. ⟪k:31⟫I think it’d do her wonders, really. ⟪k:32⟫She’s, well, you know... ⟪k:33⟫So "
"I think knowing someone cares about her’ll lighten the load a bit.”⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫"
"⟪k:36⟫“............”⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“When she comes back, give her the necklace and tell her "
"how you feel. ⟪k:40⟫And if she turns you down, we can all have a good laugh about it!”⟪k:41⟫⟪k:42⟫"
"⟪k:43⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"「한심하구만. ⟪k:0⟫똑바로 좀 말해」⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「수작을 부린 건 너잖아……!」⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「그러기라도 해"
"야 네가 말할 것 같던데?」⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫「마……, 말할 거야. ⟪k:7⟫조만간……」⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫「조만간이면 늦어, "
"지금 하자, 바로 지금. ⟪k:10⟫우리 창녀는 네가 어린이 애호가라도 딱히 뭐라고 안 해!」⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"「그런 거 아니라니까……! ⟪k:13⟫그 녀석도 그게, 뭘 어쩌든 간에 4년은 더 지나야――」⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫「그래"
"도 말만이라면 지금도 가능하잖아. ⟪k:16⟫솔직히 많은 구원이 될걸? ⟪k:17⟫그 애는 그게, 그렇다 보"
"니……. ⟪k:18⟫그러고도 누가 좋아해 준단 걸 알면 마음이 한결 나아질 거야」⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫「…………」⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫「돌아오면 목걸이 주고 마음을 전해. ⟪k:23⟫차여도 웃어넘겨 줄게!」⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫「…………」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_141DB135_3695_45D1_B53A_EA3757888757
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d59098c19f419038818891c76aab6a4fdf22d953c4abcb1dde7570111a9db28
#. default-sha256: 8b983551e096684674f0def4d4bad111a3ce24d4aa4e9797e2c37111c516afb4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_141DB135_3695_45D1_B53A_EA3757888757"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria and a few other girls chuckled.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫As uncomfortable as she was making me "
"feel, she had a point. ⟪k:4⟫Regardless of whether Morgana reciprocated my feelings or not, there "
"was a good chance that just putting them out there would help in breaking down the walls she had "
"built in her heart.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫And maybe one day... ⟪k:8⟫I would actually be able to see her "
"smile.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫(I’ll do it. I’ll tell her.)"
msgstr ""
"　마리아를 비롯한 다른 창녀들이 조금 웃었다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　영 찝찝하다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　하지만…… 정론이긴 "
"하다. ⟪k:4⟫잘 풀릴지 여부는 제쳐 두더라도―― 그 녀석의 얼어붙은 마음을 녹일 가능성은 있다.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫　어쩌면 그 후의 미래에서――⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　웃어 줄 가능성도 있다.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫(똑바로, 말하"
"자……)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7F4368ED_5327_4D09_83CF_8E274FB13B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 302bf28fc94b03eb7aa840f1b4fbcd43179e3276b36f98e22d24ecf83a0b6ed5
#. default-sha256: 31d861c268c791f6f6083c3ec11e5ee02df221e2152290b44bcaeeae102ad753
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7F4368ED_5327_4D09_83CF_8E274FB13B4D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It didn’t matter if I came out looking like a loser.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It didn’t matter if "
"Morgana wasn’t interested in me that way.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫What mattered was that she knew someone "
"accepted her, regardless of her appearance or the things she had been through.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫And if, by some chance, there really ⟪k:11⟫was⟪k:12⟫ royal blood flowing through my veins, "
"⟪k:13⟫then I could make good on my promise to show her the world.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫I could put an "
"end to her life of poverty and abuse, ⟪k:17⟫replace it with one of comfort and wealth.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫I could buy her even better medicine—something that could actually heal her face.⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫If I truly were royalty, I could do so much more for her.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"(Makes it sound like I want to be some kind of fairy tale hero or something.)"
msgstr ""
"　한심한 결과가 되더라도,⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　혹은 모르가나를 난처하게 만들더라도,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　출생과 얼굴"
"이 어떻든 간에…… 나는 개의치 않겠다 말하겠다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　그걸…… 말해야만 한다.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　게"
"다가 나에게 진짜로 왕족의 피가 흐른다면――⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　나는 그 녀석에게 넓은 세계를 보여 줄 수 있"
"다.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　핍박받는 나날을 끝내고……, 가난한 나날을 끝내고,⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　풍족한 생활을 누리"
"게 해 줄 가능성이 있다.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　돈이 있다면 더 좋은 약도 구할 수 있을 테니――, 그때는 필시 모"
"르가나의 얼굴도 완치될 것이다.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫　내가 왕족이 맞다면 말이다…….⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫ (뭐"
"야……, 무슨 이야기 속 영웅 같네)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DC57D65F_CAF4_4145_840D_BDA47478211E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b392dd04ba0d835382560aa7b3d29b228731f5e9224398bd9811e828ce65e9c
#. default-sha256: a39f9273810f49b6bc74e3b4d1819591bb46e6a0af003a9ccc50829a2fe29e38
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DC57D65F_CAF4_4145_840D_BDA47478211E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But honestly, ⟪k:1⟫I wouldn’t have minded that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫If I was going to make her "
"happy, to wipe away all her past misfortune, why couldn’t I make it a little dramatic?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫It wasn’t usually my style, but in this case, I wouldn’t have objected to a storybook ending."
msgstr ""
"　하지만――⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　나쁘진 않다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　그 녀석의 불행을 뒤집으려면 그만큼 거창해도 되리라."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　내 성미하곤 안 맞지만…… 그런 이야기 같은 일이 생겨도 되지 않을까."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4869623B_A83C_49E1_96AA_EEC94BDB18D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43295b0e850817aea9bec47c6f9d68562f1965744c8be394971238c8dfbcc1a7
#. default-sha256: 37d026d3c3e7829e56faf0ca9a2a9a86c5adc109cea772685d90942ce3dca13a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4869623B_A83C_49E1_96AA_EEC94BDB18D3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The heavy curtains separating the guest rooms had been torn to shreds, ⟪k:3⟫and "
"they were splattered with blood. ⟪k:4⟫A man, apparently caught without enough time to defend "
"himself, lay splayed out naked on a bed, his empty eyes fixed on the ceiling.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The "
"whole area reeked of blood.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“............”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫All I "
"could do was stare stupefied at the carnage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　방을 나누던 두꺼운 천막은 처참하게 찢겼다. ⟪k:2⟫그리고―― 곳곳에 피가 튀어 있었다. "
"⟪k:3⟫행위 중이라 변변한 저항도 못 했을 알몸 남자가 무참히 나뒹굴고 있었다. ⟪k:4⟫그 눈은 허공만을 "
"보았다.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　피냄새가 이 안에 독하게 충만했다.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫「…………」⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　나"
"는 처참한 광경 속에 우두커니 서 있을 수밖에 없었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_626B4A6C_5CF2_4A9B_B626_8CBAE17A7094
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cf5c75af23310deab1cf1f78dc1f7d51232a5a71683592fb28b092cccd66d1c
#. default-sha256: 6b3d89c2e818d0345fe22dc5d78a59387c1d1f0b0e293fb4f1e7604b50be1768
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_626B4A6C_5CF2_4A9B_B626_8CBAE17A7094"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“What the hell... Why... How could this happen...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My dumbfounded "
"muttering went unanswered, though. ⟪k:5⟫The few who were still alive could no better make sense "
"of the incomprehensible massacre than me. ⟪k:6⟫The sudden, arbitrary upheaval of our world. ⟪k:7⟫"
"The inexplicable, inescapable reality."
msgstr ""
"「이봐……, 대체 뭐야……, 왜…… 이렇게 된 거야……」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　그 질문에는 누구도 대답하지 못 했"
"다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　생존자는 있지만――, 그 녀석들도 이해가 못 미쳤으리라.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　이 부조리한 현실에."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　순식간에 나락으로 간 현실에.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　울고 한탄해도 바뀌지 않는 현실에."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8C8E5FB6_79F8_453D_84FF_F14001C4B3A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99dfd4ee76d90512fc4249994888093acbbbff8330d279dbda0929df17e32bb8
#. default-sha256: f9cc2abf6af26cbaf0541d39d2cf6aacbcd361d1862b9db1aa685367cd722a76
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8C8E5FB6_79F8_453D_84FF_F14001C4B3A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I was just—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I was a mere boy.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A weak boy, "
"helpless against a few robbers.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫A useless boy, unable to protect anyone."
msgstr ""
"　하지만――⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　나는,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　한낱 인간이었다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　도적도 못 이기는―― 약한 인간이"
"었다.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　아무것도 못 지키는…… 인간이었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_430AAFCC_A113_4546_B463_3D6B3028FAB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaa6daaee4fc0b2888198d15b1304a98cb7ad383e6c02a5c582694a74d28a3bd
#. default-sha256: 60a9fe4c992e613e5284e0decb9b96ad39384d7ebba605d924bc45ba3f3869c2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_430AAFCC_A113_4546_B463_3D6B3028FAB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The brothel lay in ruins, a bloody pile of torn bedding, clothes, and bodies.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I made my way back to the front... ⟪k:6⟫and all I could do was stare stupefied at the "
"carnage.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“What the hell... Why... How could this happen...?”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫My dumbfounded muttering went unanswered, though.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Maria stood beside me, "
"quietly rubbing her trembling arms."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　모든 걸 빼앗긴 후의 잔해는 몹시 처참하고 참혹하여 구원이라곤 없었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　나는 "
"입구로 돌아가……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　처참한 광경 속에 우두커니 서 있을 수밖에 없었다.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫「이"
"봐……, 대체 뭐야……, 왜…… 이렇게 된 거야……」⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　대답하는 이는 없었다.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　마"
"리아는 오한이 가시질 않는지 자꾸만 팔을 매만졌다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F22EF175_3EA6_4DE8_9A14_F951CFE0F7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 942f8351bd2d099bb42f2863871bf087f0e238b7c26e5010dfd275c02442717c
#. default-sha256: 89afb07623f6f62e7f2524c79f7130c891418741358664ce2642d41b8d31b9e5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F22EF175_3EA6_4DE8_9A14_F951CFE0F7D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Where’s Morgana...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“I couldn’t find her...”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Why not...?”⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“I’m sorry... I looked everywhere... ⟪k:10⟫but I couldn’t find her... I’m so "
"sorry...”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"「……모르가나는……」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「못 찾았어……」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「어째서……」⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「미안……, 내가 찾아다녔"
"는데……, ⟪k:6⟫안 보였어……, 미안해……」⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫「…………」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EF31B186_922E_4CFE_96DD_FEF4FA3386DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15511a1ccb2e4fa2dcffe0d18da0421198c6629bb424f68d890c2361b8e6b157
#. default-sha256: 881128f316763fcb8f26140f429f12c8f3d88a723a263ade73becf1b2e3b9c6b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EF31B186_922E_4CFE_96DD_FEF4FA3386DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanted to say I wasn’t blaming her, but I couldn’t find the words.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫If I’d "
"had power... I could have prevented this from happening.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫What ⟪k:7⟫kind⟪k:8⟫ of "
"power would I have needed, though? ⟪k:9⟫The physical strength to overpower the thieves? ⟪k:10⟫"
"No... I needed to think bigger...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫If I weren’t a peasant, but someone of real "
"influence and import,⟪k:14⟫no one would dare stand up to me. ⟪k:15⟫No petty thieves would ever "
"even consider a raid on me.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫And I would have the power to punish anyone who "
"tried.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫But regardless, ⟪k:22⟫this⟪k:23⟫ would have never happened at all."
msgstr ""
"　너를 비난하는 게 아니란 말도―― 하지 못 했다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　나에게…… 힘이 있었더라면…… 이렇게 되진 "
"않았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　하지만 그 필요한 힘이 과연 무엇일까.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　그 놈들을 제압할 무력일까.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫　아니……, 그게 아니다…….⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　내가 정점에 선 인간이라면…… 누구도 대들지 않으리라……."
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　빈민이 아니라 권위 있는 인간이라면 도적 따위에게 습격당하진 않으리라.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　"
"내게 사회적인 힘이 있었더라면…… 제재를 가하는 것도 가능할 것이고――⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　이런 사태 자체를 "
"안 일어나게 했으리라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4E6DC835_A99F_4C93_B525_678AD8A2C449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fba7d89c4d9b11ead00ed2626face043867545e7cc6d9d44e4a19b565a7da4c
#. default-sha256: d84057ae0bb8b291f00d45f6edb3cdb86ef27ea0f584b121196b0b1e1a14b2f1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4E6DC835_A99F_4C93_B525_678AD8A2C449"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was supposed to give Morgana a good life.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫To show her the world.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫To make her smile."
msgstr ""
"　모르가나를…… 구할 수 있었으리라.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　넓은 세계를 보여 줄 수 있었으리라.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　그 녀"
"석에게……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　미소를 안겨 줄 수 있었으리라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_79B56931_EAE2_4A55_A958_F20784A14276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89f194912eafc2f82683782b99ad784d184e73f28bd491b4602209899294eaa1
#. default-sha256: ce0fe8b8f2132518dd6413251c6eabc2f9b8e872716b0b1073cea94612d1f094
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_79B56931_EAE2_4A55_A958_F20784A14276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“If you had gone to speak with the lord and revealed your lineage when I first came to see "
"you, you would never have been in that kind of danger.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“There is still time. Go to the lord’s manor, show him—”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“I’m not really your "
"son, am I?”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The woman fell silent for a moment, observing me.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫I could see the resemblance between us, yes, ⟪k:17⟫and I had no memories of my mother. "
"⟪k:18⟫It would be nice if she ⟪k:19⟫were⟪k:20⟫ to show back up someday, ⟪k:21⟫but it just wasn’t "
"likely.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫This whole thing felt extremely contrived."
msgstr ""
"「현 영주에게 가서 그 혈통을 드러냈다면, 그런 비극에 휘말리진 않았을 텐데요……」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「…………」"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「지금부터라도 안 늦었습니다, 당신이 왕가 사람임을――」⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「……나는 네 아들이 아니"
"지?」⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　여자는 잠시 침묵하고 내 얼굴을 보았다.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　생김새 자체는 역시 닮은 "
"것처럼 보였다.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　나는 어머니와 산 기억이 없다.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　그러니 진짜 어머니가 나타"
"날 경우, 그건 반길 일이겠지만――⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　……그런 희망찬 경우는 존재하지 않으리라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A18C552_6D1C_4937_8FD4_F94F56BFC5EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c04f37c9c0b6268eeab99cd63d6dcf3782af0aa257c54560f956c8cb806073da
#. default-sha256: 9b53b0511ae034b8b0dafbd686fe2240d64a4c10f7715707895673e02d18b8c8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1A18C552_6D1C_4937_8FD4_F94F56BFC5EA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Discussions will progress much smoother if we both know what the other wants out of this "
"arrangement. ⟪k:1⟫Start by telling me who you really are. ⟪k:2⟫Were you actually a maidservant "
"for the previous lord?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫She gave a nod, then walked over to a grimy shelf and "
"retrieved a ring that looked very much out of place. ⟪k:7⟫It was made of gold, engraved with an "
"elaborate insignia."
msgstr ""
"「서로의 목적을 확실히 드러내는 게 훨씬 편해. ⟪k:0⟫우선 네 신원부터 밝혀. ⟪k:1⟫진짜로 영주 밑에서 "
"시녀로 일했어?」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　내 질문에 여자는 고개를 끄덕인 후, 지저분한 서랍에서 방이랑 안 어"
"울리는 반지를 꺼냈다. ⟪k:5⟫금으로 만든 정교한 반지였다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B894E5C6_9F05_4669_B349_D516FA0F9071
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38ebd8fdef41fee65c73a473e4dae9932789728d5a6376cd5aad0a66a976e4e9
#. default-sha256: 6f87803c5e0600269f23820bd3734e98f5b9353935f54c614ff9207eb001464c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B894E5C6_9F05_4669_B349_D516FA0F9071"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“But, being a woman, you have no means to accomplish that yourself. ⟪k:1⟫So you came up with "
"the idea of using a fake son. ⟪k:2⟫If your child were still alive, he would be right about my "
"age, wouldn’t he? ⟪k:3⟫And we look similar enough for you to convincingly claim we’re "
"related.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“But the biggest reason you chose me... is "
"because I’ve made something of a name for myself. ⟪k:10⟫Because I was one of the people involved "
"in inciting the revolt three years ago. ⟪k:11⟫The perfect choice to spearhead a revolution. ⟪k:12⟫"
"How dramatic, the man who set the lord’s slaves free was secretly his family. ⟪k:13⟫The people "
"would eat it right up.”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“............”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“So, how far off am I?”"
msgstr ""
"「하지만 여자 홀몸으로는 불가능해. ⟪k:0⟫그래서 가짜 아이를 만들기로 한 거야. ⟪k:1⟫아이가 살아 있다"
"면 내 나이랑 같았지? ⟪k:2⟫나는 너하고 외모가 조금 닮았으니 아이라 주장하기도 쉬워」⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"「…………」⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫「네가 특히 내게 주목한 이유는…… 내가 조금 눈에 띄는 놈이라 그런 거 아니야? "
"⟪k:7⟫3년 전 폭동에는 선동자가 있었고―― 그 중 하나가 나잖아. ⟪k:8⟫흥……, 혁명의 주도자로 삼기에도 적"
"합하지. ⟪k:9⟫예전에 노예를 해방한 게 실은 왕족의 피를 이은 남자――, 아주 극적이야. ⟪k:10⟫민중은 그"
"런 거에 사족을 못 쓰지」⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫「…………」⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫「그런 내막 맞지?」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_540A0F67_20C3_4916_A9CB_254ABB24CF48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ac8bcd00c6313128383cbd6bb98e0ec1951eb93a293c218aa80448249cce928
#. default-sha256: 6594961773a6372ff36a379dcbfd6b9adab49302a110607c710c59a811614a4a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_540A0F67_20C3_4916_A9CB_254ABB24CF48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For some time, the woman sat in silence. ⟪k:1⟫Eventually, she broke it—not by yelling in "
"anger or desperately trying to refute me—but with a smile.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I knew very well what "
"lurked behind that smile too—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫scorn.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“You’re sharp for a "
"filthy peasant. ⟪k:12⟫It would seem I chose wisely.”"
msgstr ""
"　여자는 잠시 침묵했지만, 이윽고 분노, 부정, 한탄 대신에 미소를 지었다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　그 미소가 어떠"
"한 것인지―― 나는 익히 알고 있었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　그건――⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　조소였다.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫「천민 치"
"곤 머리가 잘 도는군요. ⟪k:9⟫당신을 고르길 잘했습니다」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E915B598_C4F6_457A_BBE9_2A48B6DE830E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 571cdd9d48eac53de253aca7fbdb26f9cb0eacdc4bd4f857aa9bfd062138c66b
#. default-sha256: e39cd1efe876da00a442754b004fce30627046ae907b0a2a38ced1df9dc56c81
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E915B598_C4F6_457A_BBE9_2A48B6DE830E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was right. She was a manipulative, conniving shyster. ⟪k:1⟫But that—⟪k:2⟫that⟪k:3⟫ I could "
"work with. That fit so much better.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I wasn’t royalty. I wasn’t a hero.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫I was a filthy peasant.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“I’m in.”"
msgstr ""
"　역시…… 이 여자는 교활한 암여우였다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　자신을 위해 남을 이용하는 족속이었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　"
"하지만―― 그게 정상적인 경우이며, 나 같은 인간하고 잘 맞는다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　나는 왕족이나 영웅이 아닌"
"――⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　천민이다.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫「……네 계획에 응해 줄게」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6FB662B3_DB0A_4CC6_A107_7424922341D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23df480ac9d33225c68e3105bfe687498f8b12150f57cdeb807b9e80565c1b18
#. default-sha256: 3ed9298a99ba9b0384a23c39e661544bb8eeb2b7e96ebfbd0769a914032e8780
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6FB662B3_DB0A_4CC6_A107_7424922341D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The first thing I did after agreeing to work with the woman was not to approach "
"the lord, but to reveal my false lineage to my accomplices. ⟪k:3⟫They all thought I was joking—"
"until I showed them the ring. ⟪k:4⟫Then, their dreams of revolution started seeming far more "
"realistic.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Maria was the one exception. ⟪k:9⟫Not only did she not believe me, "
"she tried to stop me from going through with the scheme."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　그 여자의 계획에 응하기로 한 나는 맨 먼저―― 거짓으로 점철된 내 혈통을 동료들에게 밝혔"
"다. ⟪k:2⟫무작정 영주 저택으로 가진 않았다. ⟪k:3⟫동료들은 처음에는 내 말을 농담 취급했지만, 반지를 "
"보여 주니 말문을 잃었다. ⟪k:4⟫그런 후, 예전에 꿈꾼 혁명을 진심으로 실현하기로 마음먹었다.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　마리아만큼은 내 혈통을 믿으려 하지 않았다. ⟪k:8⟫오히려 내가 하려는 짓을 말리려 했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BE0A3793_8490_4606_BD02_42D44E6EEC78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 944c002e40cb1e0e527952191817304c583a6f1de3fec774ad101a1190572d71
#. default-sha256: 17edc4151dd12d485fc962325f8999445742a5f477cf41d1b93370e7edb03a83
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BE0A3793_8490_4606_BD02_42D44E6EEC78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hear me, my fellow citizens,⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫who live in suffering at the hands of "
"your supposed “lord”!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫들으라, 수탈받는 백성들이여!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_27AC972C_A7F4_4E25_9EA1_F19A4A331E17
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12d9620006720e4a11f0543ae1ffc7331568457708864330452bca83a879c410
#. default-sha256: d3f3d09d285c6b9f46d17d2943a26d6f4bf0577481386481365cc457ae82a55e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_27AC972C_A7F4_4E25_9EA1_F19A4A331E17"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Within me flows the blood of the previous lord!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫내 피에는 전 영주의 피가 흐른다!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3AFDFC3B_DE1C_4372_9397_9BF900F6B07E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9820cde812e1172814a6bdd42d2c8bc3f6d4808e614b6e0d81b5ae10ac74ea5f
#. default-sha256: 5fa1774d91493e60721ee0a98cae3b0c7c30fd620f66f43494937467c03aff36
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3AFDFC3B_DE1C_4372_9397_9BF900F6B07E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Behold, the Barniers’ golden ring!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫똑똑히 봐라, 바르니에 가문의 금반지를!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_10CAE113_76BD_4632_A81E_C45CB576001A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fee7582645b46f6183199552005648ae76e243af8a707ce321be2e8e7eff7e8
#. default-sha256: e860eb176cebf53c0622636ee7578d86c47aa62668cbc58045bce364141a4561
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_10CAE113_76BD_4632_A81E_C45CB576001A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Proof that I am of noble birth!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이게 바로 왕가 출신이란 증거!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2E462F1F_81D0_44A6_BF68_3DAB8B6DEC97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0df3d74f57e373b85fcfc416677ac1a4a243a7cfafeb1cd2bca1a06f8342eb7e
#. default-sha256: ab0df985982c61dfb7e4e16d2ff1ef1b3fee2f33fa59c83e71ed68f3ab119cc6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2E462F1F_81D0_44A6_BF68_3DAB8B6DEC97"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All of you, stand with me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫내 밑에 모여라!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E84C3D78_872E_4233_8273_D488507603B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9937209b4ed8f841a88862ca7ed45cf85c68e63b5d145362837a27a9a5378f2
#. default-sha256: 7debbbcb64a57504efa41be8888beed72d69228a98b92b85de38716995312f3c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E84C3D78_872E_4233_8273_D488507603B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My call to arms stoked the flames in the people’s hearts.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫When the "
"assault on the lord’s manor began, they were an inferno of righteous justice. ⟪k:6⟫No one was "
"thinking straight.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I was about the only one with something resembling a clear head "
"amidst the chaos.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫If I were really a hero, ⟪k:13⟫then I would have rejoiced in "
"that glorious day, that momentous turning point in the city’s history. ⟪k:14⟫I would have been "
"honored to have led the charge.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫But this was all about one woman’s avarice and "
"desire for vengeance.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫This was all about one man’s lamentation of his own "
"weakness.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫I wasn’t motivated by any desire to help these people."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　내 선언에 민중의 열기가 드높아졌다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　영주 저택을 습격하는 순간에는 모두 흥분"
"하여 이성을 잃었다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　흥분만이 등을 미는 상황 속에서――⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　나 혼자, 냉정했다.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫　내가 진짜 영웅이라면……⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　도시의 역사를 바꿀 이 순간에 환희했으리라.⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫　백성을 이끄는 것에 긍지를 느꼈으리라.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　하지만 모든 것은 한 여자의 사리사욕과 "
"원한으로부터……⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　그리고 한 남자의 한탄으로부터 시작된 것이었다.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫　나는"
"――⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫　민중을 구하려는 마음이 앞서진 않았다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8BD360AE_9B1D_4CD0_9703_57280E93CC11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56689a4e59d172bd8f72c0638f3c3ea68084d535d5a68aa6e11db031c54a783b
#. default-sha256: 726539038ad8e5d1cd066106a219c5a90226f0b01d9e4e3dbbd892aff586194c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8BD360AE_9B1D_4CD0_9703_57280E93CC11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The king and the other counts acknowledged my royalty—⟪k:3⟫though it was less "
"because I had the Barniers’ ring and more because they thought that was the best way to prevent "
"things from getting any messier.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫So with their approval, I formally became the lord "
"of the land.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I also assumed the former lord’s name, because despite his reputation "
"with his people, it was a name people knew, and one that held far more clout than my own.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And just like that... ⟪k:14⟫my longtime dream of power had come true."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　나는 왕족으로 인정받았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　내가 반지를 지닌 사실보단, 이 소동을 수습하는 데"
"에 그게 상책일 거란 결론을 진짜 왕가 사람이 내린 것이다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　그리고 이 땅을 다스리는 영주로"
"도 인정받았다.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　나는 전 영주의 이름을 이어, 그 이름을 대기로 했다.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　근본도 없"
"는 놈의 이름보단 유서 깊은 이름을 써먹는 게 더 관록이 붙는다.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　이리하여……⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫　나는 오래도록 꿈꾸던 세계를 손에 넣었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_474C1A37_B768_48C8_AC64_7E2D9225CDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe8b7cbcc430048a2ac95344442da2c0e717ceb227b620f138eea508905bdd16
#. default-sha256: 44d257928b33efe4a8fef7d123ca0507a4030c2497965d725b0c136d57b09222
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_474C1A37_B768_48C8_AC64_7E2D9225CDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That said, simply ⟪k:3⟫becoming⟪k:4⟫ the lord didn’t mean everything had fallen "
"neatly into place.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Many of the local noble families accused me of acquiring my rank "
"illegitimately. ⟪k:8⟫They waited, fangs bared, for me to slip up. ⟪k:9⟫They even tried to set me "
"up on more than one occasion.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I couldn’t trust anyone.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫On top "
"of that, if I took too long making the improvements I had promised the people, they would start "
"saying I was just as much of a tyrant as the previous lord. ⟪k:16⟫There was only so much I could "
"do at once, though, especially with my hands so full fending off the vulturous nobles.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫Exhaustion soon began to set in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　영주의 지위를 얻어도 모든 게 순탄하진 않았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　오히려 귀족들은 나를 의심하"
"고 벼락출세자라며 깔보았다. ⟪k:4⟫내가 실수를 저지르진 않을지 혈안이 되어 살폈으며, 실제로 함정까"
"지 판 적이 있었다.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　남을 믿을 만한 세계가 아니었다.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　나를 지지한 민중들도 내"
"가 발 빠르게 정치를 개선하지 못 하는가 싶으니, 「역시 저 놈도 폭군」이라 떠들기 시작했다. ⟪k:9⟫내 "
"몸뚱이를 지키는 것만 해도 벅차건만, 모든 걸 바로 해결할 수 있을 리가 없다.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　나는 점점 "
"피폐해졌다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_33EF9F7F_CD08_45A5_AAF4_D2248F54852F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f4a5583611f188088139eeb617135c9e8114d6c411d74c944bf0dfa55962704
#. default-sha256: ca24676917654b6c374999fbbeeeaf13f61c0382513fd7db937467a656c92127
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_33EF9F7F_CD08_45A5_AAF4_D2248F54852F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This wasn’t the world I was looking for—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the one I wanted to show Morgana."
msgstr "　넓은 세계는――⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　여기에도 없었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BFEFE85D_3A2B_4E79_A439_2A3027A5BDE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73ea7dbcc8639aea005e2c44a1194b65d989dc138ebb496ea55b6725aa38a32d
#. default-sha256: dc42fd902c45ac66de1eea26b31c8684f1fe08943d38d311c70f3ab3df33a78d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BFEFE85D_3A2B_4E79_A439_2A3027A5BDE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was day after draining day of betrayal, constantly having to look "
"over my shoulder, fighting to meet unrealistic expectations. I was starting to lose sight of who "
"I was as a person.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I couldn’t let anyone see me looking weak. They would see it as "
"an opportunity to take advantage of me. ⟪k:8⟫To manipulate me. ⟪k:9⟫To eliminate me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　나는 불신, 과도한 기대, 초조감, 배신의 나날 속에서 내가 어떤 인간이었는지 점"
"점 알 수 없어졌다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　하지만 마음 약해진 모습을 남에게 드러낼 수는 없다. ⟪k:6⟫드러내는 순"
"간, 그 약점을 파고드는 인간이 나타날 것이다.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　감언으로 꼬드겨 나를 이용하려는 인간이 나"
"타날 것이다. ⟪k:9⟫혹은 나를 제거하려는 인간이 나타날 것이다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_102B7478_EF5F_4DC9_B2F4_B8A1DEB59125
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b08bf4584e77aa98a58969e42ce9add1ec05bf108a5b312e6ea5d90ad034dd5
#. default-sha256: 2356ed0f8d054d01673f36ce1e0c6850ee06211cedd85eb9f39ba540b4511af0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_102B7478_EF5F_4DC9_B2F4_B8A1DEB59125"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I needed power to protect myself from those people.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Attaining rank was only "
"the first step. ⟪k:4⟫I needed even ⟪k:5⟫more⟪k:6⟫ power. ⟪k:7⟫Enough to ensure no one would ever "
"be giving me orders, could ever play me for a fool."
msgstr ""
"　그런 모든 것에게서 나를 지키려면 역시 힘이 필요했다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　힘을 얻은 것 같았지만, 그건 시작"
"에 불과한 것이었다. ⟪k:2⟫누구의 간섭도 안 받고, 속지 않기 위해선 더한 권위를 얻어야만 했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CCDD3038_63D8_4933_B381_8C06536D9476
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc8e95b4500440f7ad63abd240a962ab778e7cadbbdd409c4c934492a053a0c8
#. default-sha256: c60d902c1494cfbe21114d86c4d5c9176a47dab7c5dc7158250fe868d051b528
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CCDD3038_63D8_4933_B381_8C06536D9476"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But no one saw what I was doing.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No one believed me, even when I tried to "
"explain.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫In one case, I invited an old companion to my manor to discuss "
"matters, ⟪k:8⟫but the meeting only turned into an attempt on my life."
msgstr ""
"　하지만 내 마음은 타인에게 전해지지 않았다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　말을 하더라도 믿어 주지 않으리라.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫　한 차례, 예전 동료를 저택에 들인 적도 있었다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　하지만 정작 그때, 그 동료는――⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫　나를 죽이려 했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_61DEBAA5_0DF3_4A89_AA0B_B639C6EBA564
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30905f2e2367fdc87fc202546eaeda4bd6eeb678715c6622ad1ddfc754fdba5f
#. default-sha256: bbb6328d3cffba1b2f57f2b0fdbd1e0c3f053fb01155cd81f3238755089f045f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_61DEBAA5_0DF3_4A89_AA0B_B639C6EBA564"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Somewhere along the line, I had lost sight of my original dream. ⟪k:1⟫Lost all my desire to "
"do right by the people I cared about.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hell—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I didn’t ⟪k:8⟫have⟪k:9⟫ "
"anyone to do right by anymore."
msgstr ""
"　맨 처음에 꾸던 꿈은 어느새 멀리 사라졌다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　지키고 싶은 걸 지키겠단 마음도 사라져 갔다."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　애초에――⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　지키고 싶은 것이, 이미 존재하지도 않았다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0097DE2D_CB92_44F5_8520_ECAD2B3F07D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1eea4b11d8b14828f14d268ca091075a27fde30973119cac2631762b09cee48
#. default-sha256: a0dddbd64fb9bf18a56114016fd7788e1133a90cf6db5fd7b8fc812552a183f2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0097DE2D_CB92_44F5_8520_ECAD2B3F07D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why did I need to climb to the top of the ladder?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫So "
"no one could kill me.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why did I want money?⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫So no one could mock me.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Why did I want power?⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫"
"⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫So no one could oppose me.⟪k:29⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫왜 정점을 꿈꾸어야 했는가?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　　⟪k:4⟫――죽지 않기 위함이다.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫왜 돈"
"이 필요한가?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　　⟪k:10⟫――비웃음을 사지 않기 위함이다.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫왜 힘이 필요한가?"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　　⟪k:16⟫――힘이 있으면 누구도 나를 못 거스른다.⟪k:17⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F3EA9C43_9E64_44E7_B13D_A58734A9AC24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bd11e520ef8e241bf162b895b41ee6cf4ca4717c9559720177193f5a3b0ef9b
#. default-sha256: b0b081191437956c812708bb9d98a7cc868ff60de4bd3a784ac82eb699860158
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F3EA9C43_9E64_44E7_B13D_A58734A9AC24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Miracle blood? Sounds like a sham to me.”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫“You never know. ⟪k:6⟫"
"They say the sound of her first cry brought rain to the land where she was born, saving the whole "
"village from drought. ⟪k:7⟫And they say her blood has the power to cure any disease.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「………기적의 피? ⟪k:2⟫수상쩍군」⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「꼭 그렇진 않을걸? ⟪k:5⟫소문에 따르면 그 마녀"
"가 태어난 날에 단비가 내려 마을을 기근에서 구했다더군. ⟪k:6⟫그리고 마녀가 베푸는 피는 기적을 일으"
"켜. ⟪k:7⟫――사람의 병을 치유한다나」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6237928B_76FA_4996_8538_32D565E06097
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42b9d27e22501869c41a20c0f2d9713cb48fb267109ce977e18e246328fc3bdf
#. default-sha256: 758debb7a177f810012b18c5c33c46f5780521bf52621aa189cf05a5afc38359
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6237928B_76FA_4996_8538_32D565E06097"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The people loved their stories of heroes and miracles, ⟪k:1⟫and if I could show some support "
"for the churches, then maybe people would stop complaining I was focusing too much on the economy."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫So I devised a plot to capture the witch and make use of her “miracle blood.” ⟪k:5⟫"
"I would establish a new church, have it be run by a nun the city had been fawning over for some "
"time—they called her “the Saintess.” ⟪k:6⟫There, I would take the witch’s blood and call it a "
"miracle medicine, distributing it in exchange for tithes, which the people would certainly come "
"for in droves. ⟪k:7⟫And if the blood somehow ⟪k:8⟫did⟪k:9⟫ happen to have special powers, then "
"that would make the scheme that much more effective."
msgstr ""
"　민중은 영웅과 기적에 사족을 못 쓴다. ⟪k:0⟫상인만 지원하여 원성을 듣는 지금, 교회 운영을 후원해 "
"주면 조금이나마 지지율도 오르리라.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　나는 마녀를 사로잡아 기적의 피를 이용할 계획을 꾸몄"
"다. ⟪k:3⟫교회를 새로 차리고, 도시에서 성녀라 불려 우쭐해진 수도녀를 이용하는 것이다. ⟪k:4⟫그러고 "
"나서 기적의 피를 약으로 배포하면 기부금도 많이 들어오리라. ⟪k:5⟫실제로 기적의 힘이 있다면 더욱 효"
"과적으로 먹힌다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2B4B117D_5E12_4E2C_A09D_BE44913A6A03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6016d5e47dd435368f225ac3028db3954c0e4910685479925e856ab33469a5d2
#. default-sha256: 42ce14c79a11ff1ca8212c0b14dd709a64f498b2a620bfc5af1a5e4416668221
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2B4B117D_5E12_4E2C_A09D_BE44913A6A03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I’ll worry about the veracity of the rumors later. ⟪k:1⟫Right now, all I want is for you to "
"capture her and bring her to me.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“............”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I was too busy "
"to handle capturing the witch myself, ⟪k:9⟫so I went and found someone to handle it for me. ⟪k:10⟫"
"He was a former slave who had, several years back, massacred an entire carriage of slaves and the "
"slave traders transporting them. ⟪k:11⟫Obviously not an upstanding citizen, but there was little "
"doubt he would have any trouble apprehending a single witch.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫The biggest reason "
"I chose him, though, was because he was enamored with the nun.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I honestly "
"thought it was rather hilarious—a murderer falling in love with a nun."
msgstr ""
"「그게 참인지 거짓인지를 확인하는 건 차차 하면 돼. ⟪k:0⟫너는 그 마녀를 사로잡아 와」⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"「…………」⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　그 계획에 한 남자를 이용하기로 했다. ⟪k:6⟫내가 직접 행동하기엔 워낙 바빴"
"다. ⟪k:7⟫예전에 노예들을 학살한 내력이 있는 이질적인 자지만――, 그만한 실력이 있다면 마녀 한 명쯤"
"은 쉽게 사로잡을 거라 예상했다.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　더구나 그 남자는 수도녀에게 반한 모양이었으니 말이다."
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　살인자가 수도녀를 사랑한다니, 퍽이나 유쾌하구나 싶었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_68B6D56C_FA93_482D_93C1_6351A59C71CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db15a1397e63834059c93b5be62709d2fba9394b218679f7ab3e2143e5bf5f53
#. default-sha256: 519851de7a78d68a79c3eee29b74a0ba641efba4ebc6df2926afa8bcfd1bc823
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_68B6D56C_FA93_482D_93C1_6351A59C71CB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I thought, with what little remained of my conscience, that I was doing the right thing. "
"⟪k:1⟫If one witch—probably an old woman, at that—was all it cost to accomplish such good, then a "
"worthy sacrifice it was.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In an ideal world, it wouldn’t matter young or old—a human "
"being was an unacceptable price for anything. ⟪k:5⟫But this was far from an ideal world, ⟪k:6⟫so "
"I decided that taking what little remained of this woman’s life was the best—no, the ⟪k:7⟫"
"only⟪k:8⟫ acceptable course of action.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫She would probably despise me for "
"it, ⟪k:13⟫but I would gladly accept her hatred in exchange for the benefits her blood would bring "
"the city."
msgstr ""
"　……최소한의 양심이었다. ⟪k:0⟫사람 한 명의 희생으로 모두 이익을 본다면 나쁜 경우가 아니다. ⟪k:1⟫게"
"다가 호숫가에 사는 마녀는 이미 노인일 것이다. ⟪k:2⟫젊든 늙었든 타인을 희생해선 안 된단 것은 옳으"
"며 이상적인 사고다. ⟪k:3⟫하지만 현실은 꼭 그렇지 않다. ⟪k:4⟫그렇기에 살 날이 얼마 안 남은 자부터 "
"희생시키기로 했다.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　마녀는 나를 원망할 것이다. ⟪k:8⟫하지만…… 원망은 이미 실컷 받고 "
"산 몸이다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DA956642_2FAC_4EA6_98B5_99E9DC2909C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 282d0b7d6dabb0f2aa851c74ab0757abd17f1e5f701b28f81411ffef13cd6d9c
#. default-sha256: 14168551d6169cc0abf29cfdf97cff3408c6453266b77e5da40c3342a7bf024d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DA956642_2FAC_4EA6_98B5_99E9DC2909C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was no god. ⟪k:1⟫I was no saint.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I had blood on my hands—⟪k:5⟫I was a "
"villain.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I knew no way to accomplish good... ⟪k:9⟫without doing bad."
msgstr ""
"　나는 신도 아니거니와, 성인도 아니다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　오히려――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　이 손을 피로 물들인 악당이"
"다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　악당이 쓸 줄 아는 구제법은……⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　달리 없었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8597CA75_ADD2_4524_9F94_E5771B42ED32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5386b764a5f0268f41597c155be213d0291337883550676c3a02ab5916a3248
#. default-sha256: 1c379d25bee060227b15f86ea1b04f068435b7939c9577359f9e0f349ef231ca
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8597CA75_ADD2_4524_9F94_E5771B42ED32"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After the swordsman departed, I took some time to myself. ⟪k:1⟫I filled a goblet with water, "
"smelled it, then gave a bit of it to my pet dog before gulping down the rest of it.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫“Are you still out there somewhere, Morgana? ⟪k:6⟫What would you think of me... if you saw "
"what I had become?”"
msgstr ""
"　동양인 남자가 저택을 떠난 후, 나는 잠시 홀로 있었다.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　물을 떠서 냄새를 맡은 후, 기르"
"는 개에게 한 모금 마시게 하고서야 들이켰다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「……이봐, 모르가나……, 너는 아직 어딘가에"
"서 살아 있어?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　살아 있다면…… 너는 지금 내 모습을 보고…… 무슨 생각을 할까……」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B3CFCAF8_AE1C_4FDD_B4CB_78FD414B994E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9bf8dc841c1a45da0ef1b438fb6c2a011937824dbf36ec7a48defbcdce503ba
#. default-sha256: 2645de8241d350630eef2be83be9038d59748c880634ff4785ac2dcea86c0ec0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B3CFCAF8_AE1C_4FDD_B4CB_78FD414B994E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Tell me you didn’t harm her, dog. ⟪k:1⟫I smell blood.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“You only instructed "
"me not to kill her. ⟪k:5⟫Mistakes were made, limbs were lost.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“............”⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“I cleaned up all the blood I got on me. ⟪k:12⟫No one suspected anything.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫“............”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“That you were able to immediately recognize it as the "
"smell of blood says quite a bit, lord. ⟪k:19⟫You ⟪k:20⟫have⟪k:21⟫ killed before, haven’t "
"you?”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Enough yapping. ⟪k:25⟫She ⟪k:26⟫is⟪k:27⟫ alive, yes?”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫"
"⟪k:30⟫“Of course.”"
msgstr ""
"「이봐, 너…… 마녀에게 해를 입혔나? ⟪k:0⟫피냄새가 나잖아……」⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「죽이지 말란 말은 들었지만, "
"상해를 입히지 말란 말은 안 했잖나. ⟪k:3⟫……뜻밖의 상황도 조금 있었다」⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「…………」⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"「남의 의심을 사진 않았다. ⟪k:8⟫튄 피는 다 닦았다」⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫「…………」⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫「오히려…… 바로 "
"피냄새인 걸 알아채는군 그래. ⟪k:13⟫역시 영주, 너도 살인자다」⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫「……닥쳐. ⟪k:16⟫목숨은 붙"
"은 거 맞지?」⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫「물론이다」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4DAF8DE7_FF78_43F2_BEEC_78546A9B34BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbff7ce5fcbf203aeb3b4cdc01caa83a1c79c68dfc4dec40c13a585ed93e82d1
#. default-sha256: baa331760f9a01769081a45ed8e22bfe0f035ca31b661eef51a09a63b73fae2d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4DAF8DE7_FF78_43F2_BEEC_78546A9B34BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As soon as I saw her, ⟪k:1⟫I knew ⟪k:2⟫exactly ⟪k:3⟫who the girl was.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫But why?"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫What was ⟪k:10⟫she⟪k:11⟫ doing in the bag?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Why was ⟪k:15⟫"
"she⟪k:16⟫ the lakeside witch?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫What was ⟪k:20⟫she⟪k:21⟫ doing here?⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"⟪k:24⟫Why was ⟪k:25⟫she⟪k:26⟫ so pale and shaking?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Why had I ordered ⟪k:30⟫"
"her⟪k:31⟫ captured?⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫How could I have done that?⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫How could "
"I have let this happen to her?"
msgstr ""
"　그게,⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　누구인지……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　바로 알아봤다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　알아보고 말았다.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　하"
"지만 어째서,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　……왜 이 녀석이 이런 꼴을 당한 건가,⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　왜 호숫가의 마녀가 이 녀"
"석인가,⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　왜 이 녀석이 여기 있는 건가,⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　왜 이 녀석이 창백한 얼굴로 떨고 있"
"는가,⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　왜 내가 이 녀석을 사로잡아 오란 명령을 내렸는가,⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫　왜 내가 그런 짓"
"을 저질렀는가,⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫　왜 상황이 이렇게 된 거지?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4FFF9820_BD2D_4437_8C64_3746F809F6CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d5e1d1eed7d3c278c08cffa3f1f2756128cab2dead28ffbe5a7da03c6cb6c5b
#. default-sha256: ec041c81a6cd7cfdc9fab90c8e518060fe6ae9c874947ab115a92bbfbae2e8a2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4FFF9820_BD2D_4437_8C64_3746F809F6CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You... You remember me...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Did Morgana remember me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The "
"three years we had spent together.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫What kind of person I had been.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫The boy who had refused to give up putting ointment on her face.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Those "
"horribly unromantic encounters at the graveyard.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Her taking shots at me. Me "
"taking shots at her.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫All that time we had shared..."
msgstr ""
"「나를…… 기억하는구나……」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　기억하는구나, 모르가나.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　나와 함께 지내던 3년"
"을.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　내가 어떤 인간이었는지를.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　네 얼굴에 약을 바르던 나날을.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　너"
"는 곧잘 묘지에 갔고…… 그런 무드라곤 없는 광경 속에서……⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　내가 얄미운 소리를 하면, 너도 "
"받아쳤지――⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　그런 나날을……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_85949B79_C217_47F6_A9F7_C5C9EC61BC85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 981e18bf1d4f2b908c2f4b2b34fa66574bc44efea81a89cb9378dbd7d1a0b4b6
#. default-sha256: 696449b9aa5e14460c0ee4008ba763f48f2e25fc6948ce9c83f292ba5f4e394c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85949B79_C217_47F6_A9F7_C5C9EC61BC85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“How could I ever forget...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Morgana... she remembered me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫“How could I ⟪k:9⟫ever⟪k:10⟫ forget all the pain and humiliation you put me through?! ⟪k:11⟫"
"How could I ⟪k:12⟫ever⟪k:13⟫ forget the blood sabbats you so ⟪k:14⟫loved⟪k:15⟫ to hold?!”⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫What— ⟪k:20⟫What was she talking about...?"
msgstr ""
"「잊을 리가 없잖아……」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　기억하는구나, 모르가나…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「……잊을 리가 없"
"지…….⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　네가 나에게 준 고통과 굴욕을 어떻게 잊겠어……!⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　네가 일으킨 피의 향연"
"을…… 잊을 리가 없단 말이야……!」⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　무슨――⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　무슨, 소리야……?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_120935B9_E782_41BD_95AE_B848EF739D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bc02d81516d4d1b7abeb81a7a8c824efb0d61c207cc10efa8fd4eea1b9be7c0
#. default-sha256: 2bf97022dd9e1e591e5873831f62ab0f2514f7fc8453771724990231724d0ee9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_120935B9_E782_41BD_95AE_B848EF739D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I don’t care how much my Father preaches forgiveness... that’s the one thing you’ll never "
"get from me! ⟪k:1⟫I despise you with all my soul!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I revile you with every fiber of my "
"being! ⟪k:4⟫For every scar you gave me... ⟪k:5⟫I give you a lifetime of hatred!”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫“No, Morgana—!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“I was not aware you knew the witch, lord.”⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫His voice made my blood run cold.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫I didn’t just ⟪k:21⟫"
"know⟪k:22⟫ her.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Morgana was—"
msgstr ""
"「용서 못 해…… 너만은 용서 못 해!⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　누구보다 증오하겠어!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　누구보다 원망하겠어!"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　나를…… 평생에 걸쳐 욕보이는 너를……!⟪k:6⟫　내 생애를 걸고…… 증오하겠어……!」⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫「모르가나, 아니야――!」⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫「음, 아는 사이였나, 영주여」⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　남"
"자의 말에 피가 꽁꽁 얼어붙는 것 같았다.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　아는 사이처럼 가벼운 관계가 아니다.⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫　나는 모르가나를――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_07639842_E4A2_4909_ABB6_3E0DC91EFFBA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dddde049c041519f362d15450d814d61eac6c3b459989946938b19e76f39df0d
#. default-sha256: b92ec8a761e09c4f237ef39a68820f34454938cb72e5e2396f2b630c42e33421
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_07639842_E4A2_4909_ABB6_3E0DC91EFFBA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“This man... The lord! ⟪k:1⟫He destroyed me, mind and body!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No, that was "
"another man.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫He was already dead. I had just taken his place.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I had "
"come from the slums. I had been part of the slaves’ revolt.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫I knew I had "
"to tell her—"
msgstr ""
"「이…… 영주가! ⟪k:0⟫내 몸과 마음을…… 파괴했어……!!」⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　아니야, ⟪k:4⟫그건 다른 남자야,"
"⟪k:5⟫　그 남자는 이미 죽었고, 내가 자리를 계승한 거야,⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　나는 예전에 빈민이었고, 노예 반"
"란 때 앞장선 남자야――⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　그걸 말로 해야만 한다, 판단했음에도――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_50FBD350_6DF7_46D9_ADBD_6F3C5F82EB1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9130967455d68da6b4831ffde904d6de91fe1e7ca57956edd1bdf81aeeb55e78
#. default-sha256: 2812d9e14d25c886fa258056ca5e0c9b95915bf7cc186a5a6b935030bfed736f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_50FBD350_6DF7_46D9_ADBD_6F3C5F82EB1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“He ruined my life!”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫—but between the sting of Morgana’s accusations and "
"my need to protect my current position, I couldn’t muster the strength to do it.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫If "
"someone were to find out I wasn’t legitimate royalty, ⟪k:8⟫that I had come from the slums..."
msgstr ""
"「……모든 것의 원흉이야……!」⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　모르가나의 비난과 내 현실이 내 마음을 옭아맸다.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫　내가 실은 왕족이 아닌 빈민이란 게 들키면……⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　내 출생을 들키면……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7B92280B_08D4_41C0_8B72_37ADD123E484
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45120d0a8f5dc0d92feeeb3bce3d43105daea9821e59fad49aac2d352e95dbd9
#. default-sha256: 7c406dd2ffc3940d357fd1df076a4eb8ce1092f9b4171d183afc65ceea42e4c4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7B92280B_08D4_41C0_8B72_37ADD123E484"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫then everything I had worked so hard to build up⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫To build up "
"for who, though?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫would come crumbling down...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Do I really think it hasn’t already?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫All I had left was my power, my "
"rank...⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Is that what I actually wanted?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫"
"I couldn’t afford to lose that too...⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫When did I—⟪k:37⟫"
msgstr ""
"　내가 쌓아 올린 입장이――⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　　　　　　⟪k:2⟫누굴 위해 쌓은 입장이지?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　무너"
"지고 만다…….⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　　　　　　⟪k:8⟫이미 무너진 것 아닌가?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　지금 내가 가진 건 "
"지위와 권력 뿐이니,⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　　　　　　⟪k:14⟫그딴 거나 원했나?⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　이를 잃을 수"
"는 없다…….⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫　　　　　　⟪k:20⟫언제부터――⟪k:21⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8BD9B828_BDF2_4609_A71F_CA64605A8A69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95a41655abd7860806fc2cfaedf1e15f3adc1a3dd01251e330a05cf2972bea9a
