msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When did I first start straying from the path?⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫언제부터 목적이 바뀐 거지?⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5CE02E04_DBFD_40AC_9C60_98554641767A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00cd88d919cdbd86cf6c90798cdedf6ff4f489db66c5a3f63f6922e35ac410ad
#. default-sha256: 15b2bd2b7bce4d76354c591741a32b5145b2dd5759febefd29767d6274c23f39
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5CE02E04_DBFD_40AC_9C60_98554641767A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Yes, I know her. ⟪k:2⟫Or, I knew her, years ago...”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫“I see... What do "
"you want to do then, lord? ⟪k:6⟫You look sick.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“This doesn’t change anything... We "
"lock the witch up and proceed as planned.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「그래……, 아는 사이야. ⟪k:1⟫예전에 좀……」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「그런가……, 어쩌겠나, 영주. ⟪k:4⟫안색이 "
"안 좋다만」⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫「그대로 갈 거야, 마녀를 유폐하여…… 계획을 실행하겠어」"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6D2C6D70_9BC3_4FD6_88A7_E24794741573
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0844f4b012a0db50626d24c615dd197c856f670c75d499a6799fdae0d86571e
#. default-sha256: 0cf0d7c41e3138ae4261a1f99e02ff78b06741e15bd022d884c1b6de0d9df393
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6D2C6D70_9BC3_4FD6_88A7_E24794741573"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ever believe me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……누구에게 말해야……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B4AAEB72_A2F4_46FC_B95A_56E8016326A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b740982a9e1840de386ac16a9ba7d2f27136aa154e97eed359b0ad9b25334699
#. default-sha256: 383cd2d6550bd971224c099d7e65d94de99cc864ba70d30e7646571f2afff24c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B4AAEB72_A2F4_46FC_B95A_56E8016326A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Before me floats a man, twisted and writhing in "
"pain.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Although, whether what I’m looking at could be said to resemble a “human” "
"is a difficult question.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫It’s a hazy, indistinct shape, ⟪k:16⟫on the precipice "
"of being consumed by darkness everlasting.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫I know very well what I’m looking at—"
"⟪k:20⟫the moments before a man’s soul shatters."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　눈앞에 고통에 신음하는 남자가 있었다.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　"
"아니――, 그게 사람의 형태를 이루었느냐면 긍정하기 힘들었다.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　그 모습은 몹시 흐릿하고"
"――⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　불명료하여――⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　당장이라도 영원한 어둠에 삼켜질 것만 같았다.⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫　나는 그 모습을 안다…….⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫　자신의 존재가 바스러지는 그 순간을――⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫　안"
"다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6EDDA1CB_F4CC_477D_AB58_9A8B01666872
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 088823436341ce9c900d9ac0c9af20b868da0dd26a3b7e71be0c1710c4dbfe94
#. default-sha256: fee0ad1a7a0282f05948d6194ca232ed192f28fa7e90254c7cd23111b8797644
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6EDDA1CB_F4CC_477D_AB58_9A8B01666872"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Did I do the same thing to him... ⟪k:1⟫that Morgana did to me?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was it I who "
"summoned the darkness?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Who laid his past bare.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Who forced him to "
"relive those events, ⟪k:11⟫to experience once more everything he felt, everything he thought."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Who put him through that despair a second time.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I can only "
"imagine how he must have felt... ⟪k:18⟫causing someone he once cared for so much pain.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫The things he did are abhorrent, more than deserving of reproach—⟪k:22⟫and it would "
"undoubtedly be easier for him to simply vanish into the eternal abyss."
msgstr ""
"　이건…… 모르가나가 내게 했듯이……⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　내가…… 남자를 이렇게 만든 걸까.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　내가…… 저"
"택의 어둠을 불러낸 것일까.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　그리고 남자의 과거를 들춘 것일까…….⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　내가 남자가 "
"보기 싫은 것을 보게 하여……⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　그때의 감정과 마음을 되돌린 결과,⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　두 번째 절망"
"을 겪게 하는 것일까.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　제 손으로 소중히 여기던 이를 상처 입힌 남자의 심정을――⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫　정확히 가늠하는 건 불가능했다.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　그 행위는 악랄했으며…… 비난받아 마땅하기에"
"――⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫　남자 입장에선 이대로 소멸하고 싶으리라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD55D19C_1210_429C_A8EE_AEF6FFA17DC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45263c387cfc92c35500852d1e3a1de86954db8dd4ba3cd1e2b1be9b715c0114
