msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_550BE920_6ED2_4351_B1B1_B67077623447"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I grab the man by the arm and begin scouring the blackness for an exit.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫After "
"some time, I see a speck glistening high above, ⟪k:4⟫so I make my way upwards.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Back "
"into the harsh light of the real world."
msgstr ""
"　나는 그 남자를 잡고――⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　어둠의 출구를 찾았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　이윽고 시야에 들어온 빛 하나"
"를 발견하여――⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　위로 갔다.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　바로 그…… 우리의 비정한 현실로."

